OL,3,A'Quiet quitting' could be hitting the
OL,4,Aeconomy - here's why
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe so-called "quiet quitting" trend
OL,7,Fwhere workers do the basic requirements
OL,8,Fof a job but refuse to do anything more
OL,9,Fmight be hitting the economy, analysis
OL,10,Fhas found.
OL,12,FOver the last decade, Britons have
OL,13,Fbecome less engaged with the jobs they
OL,14,Fdo and are less willing to put in extra
OL,15,Feffort, according to a Resolution
OL,16,FFoundation report.
OL,18,FThe thinktank said this could partly
OL,19,Fhelp explain the slump in productivity
OL,20,Fsince the pandemic.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
